sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 👤 User
    participant AI as 🤖 AI Agent
    participant MCP as 🔌 MCP Server
    participant Plugin as 🧩 PluginHost
    participant Target as ☁️ Target

    rect rgb(219, 234, 254)
        Note over User,Target: 🔍 SCAN
        User->>AI: @Shield scan
        AI->>MCP: scan_environment
        MCP->>Plugin: scan()
        Plugin->>Target: listResources()
        Target-->>Plugin: resources
        Plugin-->>MCP: findings
        MCP-->>AI: findings + score
        AI-->>User: 📊 Report with 14 findings
    end

    rect rgb(254, 243, 199)
        Note over User,Target: 📋 APPROVE
        User->>AI: @Shield fix critical
        AI->>MCP: approve_remediation
        MCP->>MCP: check RBAC role
        MCP-->>AI: "pending execution"
        AI-->>User: ⚠️ Proposed fixes (review only)
        User->>AI: @Shield approve
        AI->>MCP: execute_remediation
    end

    rect rgb(209, 250, 229)
        Note over User,Target: ⚡ REMEDIATE
        MCP->>Plugin: remediate(finding)
        Plugin->>Target: disablePublicAccess()
        Target-->>Plugin: success
        Plugin->>Target: verify()
        Target-->>Plugin: verified
        Plugin-->>MCP: result + evidence
        MCP->>MCP: record audit + update score
        MCP-->>AI: ✅ completed
        AI-->>User: 📈 Score improved 7 → 92
    end
